  "decision": {
    "proposals": "Steve and Elena independently proposed the same persistent helper and challenged synchronous native focus restoration versus local/deferred ownership. Both accepted with native replay as the reservation. Root owns implementation.",
    "review": "Both find no actionable route defect. Steve withdrew a profile-confirmation evidence objection after inspecting the newer profile-dialog record that supersedes the old BODY result.",
    "nativeResolution": "Keyboard route destinations prove post-close trigger ownership works in this macOS runtime; no deferred/local focus owner was needed."
  },
